OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CNext round of BBC cuts will be more    
OL,5,Cnoticeable to audiences, report warns  
OL,6,GFurther job losses and programme cuts  
OL,7,Gat the BBC will be more noticeable to  
OL,8,Gaudiences than previous savings        
OL,9,Gmeasures, a new report has warned.     
OL,11,FThe corporation announced plans        
OL,12,Fearlier this year to cut about 1,800   
OL,13,Froles and close some programmes and    
OL,14,Fservices, but it has further savings   
OL,15,Fto make to reach its #500m target.     
OL,17,FIn its report, the National Audit      
OL,18,FOffice (NAO) anticipated the BBC's     
OL,19,Fnext round of cost-cutting measures    
OL,20,Fwould be more difficult to deliver and 
OL,21,Fmore perceptible to audiences.         
OL,22,C]DTV    520  Lottery   555  Music 530  
OL,23,C]DFilms 540  Newsround 570  Games 550  
